Model weights
-------------
This product does not include model weights. At runtime, it can download
model weights from Hugging Face. These weights have their own licenses:

- Liquid AI d1 models (for example d1-omni-600M): LFM Open License v1.0.
  Copyright Liquid AI, Inc. https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI
- ModernBERT zero-shot models: Apache License 2.0.
  https://huggingface.co/MoritzLaurer
- Indra OCR models (det.onnx, rec.onnx, meta.json, revision v1.1.0), by
  Datalab: modified OpenRAIL-M license. https://huggingface.co/datalab-to/indra-ocr
  License: https://huggingface.co/datalab-to/indra-ocr/blob/v1.1.0/LICENSE
  The use restrictions in Attachment A of that license apply to all users of
  these models. In summary: use them only for lawful purposes, and, if your
  organization has more than USD 20 million in annual revenue or funding, or
  competes with Datalab, use them only for personal use or research.
  src/lib/classifier/indra/ is a TypeScript port of parts of the Indra OCR
  Python package (Apache License 2.0, https://github.com/datalab-to/indra).

